:36:\"为内容或表单配置可用显示\";s:25:\"Manage custom view modes.\";s:30:\"管理自定义查看模式。\";s:25:\"Manage custom form modes.\";s:30:\"管理自定义表单模式。\";s:28:\"Manage menus and menu links.\";s:30:\"管理菜单和菜单链接。\";s:71:\"Create and manage fields, forms, and display settings for your content.\";s:57:\"创建和管理内容的字段、表单和显示设置。\";s:67:\"Manage tagging, categorization, and classification of your content.\";s:36:\"管理Tag，分类和内容类型。\";s:35:\"Manage customized lists of content.\";s:36:\"管理经过定制的内容列表。\";s:34:\"Create and manage Paragraph types.\";b:1;s:19:\"Manage media types.\";s:21:\"管理媒体类型。\";s:28:\"Select and configure themes.\";s:24:\"选择并配置主题。\";s:53:\"Add and install modules to extend site functionality.\";b:1;s:20:\"Administer settings.\";s:15:\"管理设置。\";s:78:\"Configure styles that can be used for resizing or adjusting images on display.\";s:63:\"配置可用于显示时改变尺寸或调整图片的样式。\";s:67:\"Configure the location of uploaded files and how they are accessed.\";s:60:\"配置上传文件的位置，以及访问文件的方式。\";s:74:\"Choose which image toolkit to use if you have installed optional toolkits.\";s:78:\"如果您安装了其它的图像工具包，请选择其对图像的处理。\";s:22:\"Manage media settings.\";s:21:\"管理媒体设置。\";s:30:\"Manage Media Library settings.\";s:25:\"管理多媒体库设置.\";s:115:\"Configure the site description, the number of items per feed, and whether feeds should be titles/teasers/full-text.\";s:95:\"配置网站描述，每个feed的组件数量，以及feed是否为titles/teasers/full-text。\";s:43:\"Enable or disable the menu linkset endpoint\";s:36:\"启用或禁用菜单链接集端点\";s:36:\"Configure and use development tools.\";s:30:\"配置并使用开发工具。\";s:37:\"Import and export your configuration.\";s:24:\"导入和导出配置。\";s:62:\"Take the site offline for updates and other maintenance tasks.\";s:66:\"将站点置为离线，以便进行更新和其他维护任务。\";s:45:\"Configure caching and bandwidth optimization.\";s:30:\"配置缓存和带宽优化。\";s:36:\"Configure theme development settings\";s:24:\"配置主题开发设置\";s:61:\"Configure the display of error messages and database logging.\";s:45:\"配置错误消息显示和数据库日志。\";s:59:\"Configure regional settings, localization, and translation.\";s:42:\"配置区域设置、