ntly been logged.\";s:30:\"查看最近的事件日志。\";s:36:\"View \'page not found\' errors (404s).\";s:45:\"查看“没有找到页面”错误(404s)。\";s:35:\"View \'access denied\' errors (403s).\";s:39:\"查看“拒绝访问”错误(403s)。\";s:39:\"Overview of fields on all entity types.\";s:36:\"所有实体类型的字段总览。\";s:48:\"Get a status report about your site\'s operation.\";s:42:\"获得关于站点操作的状态报告。\";s:38:\"Overview of plugins used in all views.\";s:36:\"预览所有视图使用的插件。\";s:33:\"View most popular search phrases.\";b:1;s:82:\"Get a status report about available updates for your installed modules and themes.\";s:60:\"获取您所安装模块和模板的可用更新的报告。\";s:36:\"Overview of plugins used in metatag.\";b:1;s:97:\"Get a status report about available interface translations for your installed modules and themes.\";s:72:\"获得一份已安装模块和主题的可用界面翻译状态报告。\";s:45:\"Manage user accounts, roles, and permissions.\";s:39:\"管理用户账号、角色和权限。\";s:13:\"Announcements\";s:6:\"公告\";s:4:\"Help\";s:6:\"帮助\";s:8:\"Comments\";s:6:\"评论\";s:11:\"Add content\";s:12:\"添加内容\";s:17:\"Add content block\";s:18:\"添加内容区块\";s:6:\"Blocks\";s:6:\"区块\";s:13:\"Media library\";s:9:\"媒体库\";s:9:\"Add media\";s:12:\"添加媒体\";s:5:\"Media\";s:6:\"媒体\";s:5:\"Files\";s:6:\"文件\";s:7:\"Content\";s:6:\"内容\";s:12:\"Block layout\";s:12:\"区块布局\";s:11:\"Block types\";s:12:\"区块类型\";s:13:\"Comment types\";s:12:\"评论类型\";s:12:\"Inaccessible\";s:15:\"不可访问的\";s:16:\"Add contact form\";s:15:\"添加联系表\";s:13:\"Contact forms\";s:12:\"联系表单\";s:10:\"View modes\";s:12:\"查看模式\";s:10:\"Form modes\";s:12:\"表单模式\";s:13:\"Display modes\";s:12:\"显示模式\";s:8:\"Add menu\";s:12:\"添加菜单\";s:5:\"Menus\";s:6:\"菜单\";s:16:\"Add content type\";s:18:\"添加内容类型\";s:13:\"Content types\";s:12:\"内容类型\";s:14:\"Add vocabulary\";s:15:\"添加词汇表\";s:8:\"Taxonomy\";s:6:\"分类\";s:8:\"Add view\";s:12:\"添加视图\";s:5:\"Views\";s:6:\"视图\";s:18:\"Add paragraph type\";s:18:\"添加段落类型\";s:15:\"Paragraph types\";s:12:\"段落类型\";s:14:\"Add media type\";s:18:\"添加媒体类型\";s:11:\"Media types\";s:12:\"媒体类型\";s:9:\"Structure\";s:6:\"结构\";s:6:\"Update\";s:6:\"更新\";s:8:\"Settings