field_description\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:296:\"<p>IT Consultis is an award-winning Digital Transformation Consultancy in China and APAC, empowering the most ambitious Fortune 500 companies with the right strategy &amp; execution playbook leveraging MarTech, e-Commerce, and Omnichannel solutions to grow revenue and build customer loyalty.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:402:\"<p>IT Consultis（朗高投资咨询（上海）有限公司）成立于2008年，总部位于中国上海，是一家屡获殊荣的数字转型咨询公司，专注于中国及亚太市场。我们为最具雄心的《财富》500强企业提供战略与执行方案，通过营销技术（MarTech）、电子商务和全渠道解决方案助力企业实现收入增长与客户忠诚度提升。</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}}s:24:\"field_text_in_background\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:179:\"<p>Our team consists of 60+ highly motivated talents from 14 different nationalities based in 3 countries across Asia, from Shanghai, China, to Saigon, Vietnam, and Singapore.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:171:\"<p>我们的团队由来自 14 个不同国家的 60 多名积极进取的人才组成, 分布在亚洲的 3 个国家，从中国上海到越南胡志明和新加坡.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}}s:11:\"field_title\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:40:\"Reimagining Your Digital Future Together\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:24:\"携手重塑数字未来\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:12:\"section_text\";s:2:\"id\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"efe25548-c537-43