e can do everything we set our minds to. Challenges are here for us to tackle - Obstacle is the Way. New knowledge and skills are keys to helping service our clients to beat their competitors. Our commitment is to find solutions to any problem we encounter. We never give up until we find the best way forward. “We figure it out” is more than a value we hold, it is a way of life for us.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:407:\"<p>我们天生就是问题解决者，深信只要下定决心，就能克服任何挑战。\"障碍即道路\"是我们的信条。新知识与新技能是我们帮助客户战胜竞争对手的关键。我们承诺为每一个问题找到解决方案，永不放弃，直到找到最佳的前进路径。\"我们探索解决方案\"不仅是我们的核心价值观，更是我们日常的生活方式。</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:1:\"6\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:1:\"6\";}}}s:11:\"field_title\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:16:\"We Figure It Out\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:24:\"我们探索解决方案\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"value_item\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"12\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"9d7efea7-2aad-4000-8a26-1b1f8a9fab06\";s:8:\"revision\";s:3:\"434\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:8:\"langcode\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";s:7:\"zh-hans\";s:7:\"zh-hans\";}s:9:\"published\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"zh-hans\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"zh-hans\";s:1:\"0\";}s: