ty for our actions and decisions are in our DNA. Taking responsibility rather than blaming others or making excuses and also taking responsibility towards our clients to deliver the best solution out there for them to have the best ROI. We win over our partners\' trust and influence our industry. We create a culture of trust, integrity, and collaboration, where we all contribute to the success of our organization and of our clients.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:478:\"<p>责任意识、主动担当以及对自己行为决策的负责精神已深深融入我们的DNA。我们选择主动承担责任，而非推诿找借口，更重要的是，我们对客户负责，致力于为其提供最佳解决方案，实现最优的投资回报。我们赢得了合作伙伴的信任，并积极影响行业的发展。我们致力于营造信任、诚信与协作的文化，每个人都为组织和客户的共同成功贡献着自己的力量。</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:1:\"7\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:1:\"7\";}}}s:11:\"field_title\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:9:\"We Own It\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:18:\"我们勇于担当\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"value_item\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"13\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"1b7a22bd-eb89-4807-9951-f2e1aeda5469\";s:8:\"revision\";s:3:\"435\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:8:\"langcode\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";s:7:\"zh-hans\";s:7:\"zh-hans\";}s:9:\"published\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"zh-hans\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:2: