he power of teamwork and support, and we are always willing to lend a hand to help our colleagues and make an unstoppable team. We are a resilient group, always striving for results and motivated by a shared passion and excitement for what we do.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:307:\"<p>我们为集体的成功而生，深信团队协作与相互支持的力量。我们始终乐于伸出援手，帮助同事，打造一个无坚不摧的团队。我们是一个坚韧的集体，始终追求卓越成果。共同的热情与对工作的热爱，是我们持续前进的不竭动力。</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:1:\"8\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:1:\"8\";}}}s:11:\"field_title\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:12:\"We, the TEAM\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:21:\"我们是一个团队\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"value_item\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"14\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"fa31c30b-df88-440b-8b2c-a94dae69a28b\";s:8:\"revision\";s:3:\"436\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:8:\"langcode\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";s:7:\"zh-hans\";s:7:\"zh-hans\";}s:9:\"published\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"zh-hans\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"zh-hans\";s:1:\"0\";}s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;s:7:\"zh-hans\";N;}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";s:3:\"43