 expansion and development of ITC in China and Asia. 15+ years of experience advising Fortune 500 C-levels (VP, CIO, CDO, CMO, CTO, GM, etc…) on their brands’ digital acceleration. Always happy to discuss and consult new clients on Private Traffic, eCommerce, sCRM, WeCom, Data Capture, Omnichannel, Loyalty, and how to build the China roadmap the right way. ”</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:421:\"<p>“连续创业者，推动中国及亚洲市场的整体扩展与发展。拥有15 年以上经验，曾为《财富》500强企业的高管(CIO、CDO、CMO、CTO、总经理等)提供数字化加速战略咨询。乐于探讨并为新客户提供咨询，涉及私域流量、电商、企业微信、数据采集、全渠道运营、会员忠诚度计划以及如何正确制定中国市场发展路线图。 ”</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"10\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"10\";}}}s:15:\"field_job_title\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:26:\"Co-Founder, Vice President\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:27:\"联合创始人，副总裁\";}}}s:10:\"field_mind\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:47:\"<p>COMMUNICATIVE<br>PASSIONATE<br>INSPIRING</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:33:\"<p>传播<br>激情<br>启发</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}}s:11:\"field_title\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:15:\"Aurelien Rigart\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:15:\"Aurelien Rigart\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"\0*\0entit