logy development services for various industries worldwide.&nbsp;<br>Ultimately, we help our clients develop the best strategies and playbook set-up along with the right digital enablers to achieve their objectives in China, Asia, and other markets.</p><p>Find your next success path with our combined strategic and technology expertis</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:326:\"<p>ITC为全球各行业提供全面的战略咨询与科技开发服务。我们最终致力于协助客户制定最优战略与执行手册，并辅以恰当的数字化工具，助其在中国、亚洲乃至全球市场实现目标。</p><p>融合战略思维与技术专长，与您共同探索下一段成功之路。</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}}s:18:\"field_pillar_items\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:4:{i:0;a:2:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:1:\"2\";s:18:\"target_revision_id\";s:3:\"424\";}i:1;a:2:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:1:\"3\";s:18:\"target_revision_id\";s:3:\"425\";}i:2;a:2:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:1:\"4\";s:18:\"target_revision_id\";s:3:\"426\";}i:3;a:2:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"19\";s:18:\"target_revision_id\";s:3:\"427\";}}}s:11:\"field_title\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:52:\"The 4 Pillars to Realize Our Vision for Your Success\";}}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:30:\"实现您成功的四大支柱\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}s:7:\"zh-hans\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:15:\"section_pillars\";s:2:\"id\";s:1:\"6\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"264d29b8-b095-4790-aaa3-a15f7a3ab17c\";s:8:\"revision\";s:3:\"428\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:8:\"langcode\";a:2:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";s:7:\"zh-hans\