-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[30px] leading-[36px] text-itc-black mb-0\">\n          \n            <div>我们的核心价值观</div>\n      \n        </h2>\n      \n                      <div class=\"font-[\'Lato\',sans-serif] text-[16px] leading-[30px] text-itc-dark-gray mt-[30px] md:px-[97px] max-w-[1000px] mx-auto\">\n          \n            <div><p>我们的核心价值观定义了ITC，紧密连接我们每一位成员，并指引着我们的每一个行动。这些价值观不仅推动着我们的业务增长，也助力客户实现成功。</p></div>\n      \n        </div>\n          </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[40px]\">\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          <div class=\"paragraph-value-item\">\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-[20px] p-[30px] md:py-[40px] md:px-[30px] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-sm w-full max-w-[780px] mx-auto\">\n\n                    <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[100px] h-[100px] md:w-[130px] md:h-[130px] mb-[25px] md:mb-0 md:mr-[30px] flex items-center justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center [&_img]:max-h-full [&_img]:max-w-full [&_img]:w-auto [&_img]:h-auto [&_img]:object-contain\">\n          \n            <div><div class=\"contextual-region\">\n  <div data-contextual-id=\"media:media=6:changed=1765012700&amp;langcode=zh-hans\" data-contextual-token=\"T3ZuohWh-KJLrNRLpXI541xYPe7n1m4JJltXDdd2zv4\" data-drupal-ajax-container=\"\"></div>\n  \n  <div>\n    <div class=\"visually-hidden\">图像</div>\n              <div>  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2025-12/Innovation.png\" width=\"520\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Innovation\" />\n\n</div>\n          </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n      \n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n        <div class=\"flex-grow\">\n                    <h3 class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[20px] leading-[28px] text-itc-black mb-[10px]\">\n          \n            <div>我们探索解决方案</div>\n      \n        </h3>\n      \n                    <div class=\"font-[\'Lato\',sans-serif] text-[16px] leading-[30px] text-itc-dark-gray\">\n          \n            <div><p>我们天生就是问题解决者，深信只要下定决心，就能克服任何挑战。\"障碍即道路\"是我们的信条。新知识与新技能是我们帮助客户战胜竞争对手的关键。我们承诺为每一个问题找到解决方案，永不放弃，直到找到最佳的前进路径。\"我们探索解决方案\"不仅是我们的核心价值观，更是我们日常的生活方式。</p></div>\n      \n        </div>\n          </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n                                <div class=\"paragraph-value-item\">\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-[20px] p-[30px] md:py-[40px] md:px-[30px] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-sm w-full max-w-[780px] mx-auto\">\n\n                    <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[100px] h-[100px] md:w-[130px] md:h-[130px] mb-[25px] md:mb-0 md:mr-[30px] flex items-center justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center [&_img]:max-h-full [&_img]:max-w-full [&_img]:w-auto [&_img]:h-auto [&_img]:object-contain\">\n          \n            <div><div class=\"contextual-region\">\n  <div data-contextual-id=\"media:media=7:changed=1765012739&amp;langcode=zh-hans\" data-contextual-token=\"NQZmZR5NeeYgguryHMYXRFC_varCwSlyyvGhx6iGfF4\" data-drupal-ajax-container=\"\"></div>\n  \n  <div>\n    <div class=\"visually-hidden\">图像</div>\n              <div>  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2025-12/Accountability.png\" width=\"520\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Accountability\" />\n\n</div>\n          </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n      \n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n        <div class=\"flex-grow\">\n                    <h3 class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[20px] leading-[28px] text-itc-black mb-[10px]\">\n          \n            <div>我们勇于担当</div>\n      \n        </h3>\n      \n                    <div class=\"font-[\'Lato\',sans-serif] text-[16px] leading-[30px] text-itc-dark-gray\">\n          \n            <div><p>责任意识、主动担当以及对自己行为决策的负责精神已深深融入我们的DNA。我们选择主动承担责任，而非推诿找借口，更重要的是，我们对客户负责，致力于为其提供最佳解决方案，实现最优的投资回报。我们赢得了合作伙伴的信任，并积极影响行业的发展。我们致力于营造信任、诚信与协作的文化，每个人都为组织和客户的共同成功贡献着自己的力量。</p></div>\n      \n        </div>\n          </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n                                <div class=\"paragraph-value-item\">\n  <div class=\"bg-white rounded-[20px] p-[30px] md:py-[40px] md:px-[30px] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-sm w-full max-w-[780px] mx-auto\">\n\n                    <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[100px] h-[100px] md:w-[130px] md:h-[130px] mb-[25px] md:mb-0 md:mr-[30px] flex items-center justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center [&_img]:max-h-full [&_img]:max-w-full [&_img]:w-auto [&_img]:h-auto [&_img]:object-contain\">\n          \n            <div><div class=\"contextual-region\">\n  <div data-contextual-id=\"media:media=8:changed=1765012770&amp;langcode=zh-hans\" data-contextual-token=\"RiB8Kx2BZzj7qW8NC3tVvd5cJU2Zj0Kfbl5-PrHRxnU\" data-drupal-ajax-container=\"\"></div>\n  \n  <div>\n    <div class=\"visually-hidden\">图像</div>\n              <div>  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2025-12/teamwork.png\" width=\"520\" height=\"520\" alt=\"teamwork\" />\n\n</div>\n          </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n      \n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n        <div class=\"flex-grow\">\n                    <h3 class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[20px] leading-[28px] text-itc-black mb-[10px]\">\n          \n            <div>我们是一个团队</div>\n      \n        </h3>\n      \n                    <div class=\"font-[\'Lato\',sans-serif] text-[16px] leading-[30px] text-itc-dark-gray\">\n          \n            <div><p>我们为集体的成功而生，深信团队协作与相互支持的力量。我们始终乐于伸出援手，帮助同事，打造一个无坚不摧的团队。我们是一个坚韧的集体，始终追求卓越成果。共同的热情与对工作的热爱，是我们持续前进的不竭动力。</p></div>\n      \n        </div>\n          </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n                                              </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n              <div><div class=\"paragraph-section-carousel bg-white py-[50px] px-[15px] md:py-[100px] md:px-[150px] overflow-hidden\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto js-carousel-wrapper relative\">\n\n              <div class=\"text-center mb-[80px] md:mb-[100px]\">\n        <h2 class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[30px] leading-[36px] text-itc-black mb-0\">\n          \n            <div>领导</div>\n      \n        </h2>\n      </div>\n    \n            <div class=\"relative group z-10\">\n\n            <div class=\"swiper js-carousel-container\">\n        <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                <div class=\"paragraph-carousel-item w-full\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-[30px] md:gap-[40px] items-stretch max-w-[1100px] mx-auto\">\n\n              <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-full md:w-[300px] relative\">\n        <div class=\"rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden h-full w-full absolute inset-0 md:relative\">\n          <div class=\"w-full h-full [&_img]:w-full [&_img]:h-full [&_img]:object-cover\">\n            \n            <div><div class=\"contextual-region\">\n  <div data-contextual-id=\"media:media=9:changed=1765012902&amp;langcode=zh-hans\" data-contextual-token=\"xo5QR_ggbfnKweN0C2Rc1EfOBDSDNbJTXJS3nbjR8gE\" data-drupal-ajax-container=\"\"></div>\n  \n  <div>\n    <div class=\"visually-hidden\">图像</div>\n              <div>  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2025-12/Yoan.png\" width=\"644\" height=\"860\" alt=\"Yoan\" />\n\n</div>\n          </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n      \n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"md:hidden h-[300px]\"></div>\n      </div>\n    \n        <div class=\"flex-grow text-center md:text-left flex flex-col\">\n\n                    <h3 class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-medium text-[30px] leading-[40px] text-itc-black mb-[5px]\">\n          \n            <div>Yoan Rigart Lenisa</div>\n      \n        </h3>\n      \n                            <div class=\"font-[\'Lato\',sans-serif] text-[20px] leading-[30px] text-itc-black mb-[20px]\">\n          \n            <div>联合创始人、首席执行官</div>\n      \n        </div>\n      \n                    <div class=\"font-serif italic text-[16px] leading-[30px] text-itc-black mb-[20px]\">\n          \n            <div><p>“具有长期战略视野的天生领导者，负责企业的财务、人力资源及法律相关事务的统筹运营，确保公司始终朝着正确的方向发展，并关注每位员工的职业及个人成长。”</p></div>\n      \n        </div>\n      \n                    <div class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[40px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.1] text-gray-200 uppercase tracking-wider select-none\">\n          \n            <div><p>深思熟虑<br>先锋<br>战略</p></div>\n      \n        </div>\n      \n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n              </div>\n                                                <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                <div class=\"paragraph-carousel-item w-full\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-[30px] md:gap-[40px] items-stretch max-w-[1100px] mx-auto\">\n\n              <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-full md:w-[300px] relative\">\n        <div class=\"rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden h-full w-full absolute inset-0 md:relative\">\n          <div class=\"w-full h-full [&_img]:w-full [&_img]:h-full [&_img]:object-cover\">\n            \n            <div><div class=\"contextual-region\">\n  <div data-contextual-id=\"media:media=10:changed=1765013003&amp;langcode=zh-hans\" data-contextual-token=\"inOSa7KOeQknAG6Ys0wD3pjw4Zb4I4F87K1Yv0KSL-Q\" data-drupal-ajax-container=\"\"></div>\n  \n  <div>\n    <div class=\"visually-hidden\">图像</div>\n              <div>  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2025-12/Aurelien-Rigart-IT-Consultis-768x1024.png\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Aurelien Rigart\" />\n\n</div>\n          </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n      \n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"md:hidden h-[300px]\"></div>\n      </div>\n    \n        <div class=\"flex-grow text-center md:text-left flex flex-col\">\n\n                    <h3 class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-medium text-[30px] leading-[40px] text-itc-black mb-[5px]\">\n          \n            <div>Aurelien Rigart</div>\n      \n        </h3>\n      \n                            <div class=\"font-[\'Lato\',sans-serif] text-[20px] leading-[30px] text-itc-black mb-[20px]\">\n          \n            <div>联合创始人，副总裁</div>\n      \n        </div>\n      \n                    <div class=\"font-serif italic text-[16px] leading-[30px] text-itc-black mb-[20px]\">\n          \n            <div><p>“连续创业者，推动中国及亚洲市场的整体扩展与发展。拥有15 年以上经验，曾为《财富》500强企业的高管(CIO、CDO、CMO、CTO、总经理等)提供数字化加速战略咨询。乐于探讨并为新客户提供咨询，涉及私域流量、电商、企业微信、数据采集、全渠道运营、会员忠诚度计划以及如何正确制定中国市场发展路线图。 ”</p></div>\n      \n        </div>\n      \n                    <div class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[40px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.1] text-gray-200 uppercase tracking-wider select-none\">\n          \n            <div><p>传播<br>激情<br>启发</p></div>\n      \n        </div>\n      \n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n              </div>\n                                                                          </div>\n      </div>\n\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"js-carousel-prev carousel-arrow left-0 hidden md:flex focus:outline-none\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\">\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"w-5 h-5\">\n          <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18\" />\n        </svg>\n      </button>\n\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"js-carousel-next carousel-arrow right-0 hidden md:flex focus:outline-none\" aria-label=\"Next slide\">\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"w-5 h-5\">\n          <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3\" />\n        </svg>\n      </button>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n          </div>\n  \n  </div>\n\n</article>\n\";}s:9:\"#attached\";a:3:{s:14:\"html_head_link\";a:0:{}s:7:\"library\";a:19:{i:0;s:20:\"history/mark-as-read\";i:1;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:2;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:3;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:4;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:5;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:6;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:7;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:8;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:9;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:10;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:11;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:12;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:13;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:14;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:15;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:16;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:17;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";i:18;s:40:\"paragraphs/drupal.paragraphs.unpublished\";}s:14:\"drupalSettings\";a:1:{s:7:\"history\";a:1:{s:17:\"nodesToMarkAsRead\";a:1:{i:1;b:1;}}}}s:6:\"#cache\";a:3:{s:8:\"contexts\";a:8:{i:0;s:26:\"languages:language_content\";i:1;s:8:\"url.site\";i:2;s:22:\"languages:langua