('entity_view:node:1:search_index:en:[languages:language_interface]=en:[theme]=itc_theme:[user.permissions]=d6b2bb804dbcb1862c52f3d78b6a364c29eda7d31395046de91c9f6dccd2104d','O:31:\"Drupal\\Core\\Cache\\CacheRedirect\":3:{s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:4:{i:0;s:28:\"languages:language_interface\";i:1;s:5:\"theme\";i:2;s:16:\"user.permissions\";i:6;s:8:\"timezone\";}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;}',-1,1765157283.821,1,'','0'),
('entity_view:node:1:search_index:zh-hans:[languages:language_interface]=en:[theme]=itc_theme:[timezone]=Asia/Shanghai:[user.permissions]=d6b2bb804dbcb1862c52f3d78b6a364c29eda7d31395046de91c9f6dccd2104d','a:3:{s:7:\"#markup\";O:25:\"Drupal\\Core\\Render\\Markup\":1:{s:9:\"\0*\0string\";s:24568:\"<h1>关于我们 - IT Consultis CN</h1>\n<span>关于我们 - IT Consultis CN</span>\n\n<span><span>itc-admin</span></span>\n\n<span><time datetime=\"2025-12-06T17:25:09+08:00\" title=\"星期六, 十二月 6, 2025 - 17:25\">周六, 12/06/2025 - 17:25</time>\n</span>\n\n      <div>\n              <div>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph-section-text\">\n\n  <div class=\"bg-white py-[50px] px-[15px] md:py-[100px] md:px-[150px] text-center\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto\">\n              <h2 class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[30px] leading-[36px] text-itc-black mb-0\">\n          \n            <div>携手重塑数字未来</div>\n      \n        </h2>\n      \n              <div class=\"font-[\'Lato\',sans-serif] text-[16px] leading-[30px] text-itc-dark-gray mt-[30px] md:px-[97px]\">\n          \n            <div><p>IT Consultis（朗高投资咨询（上海）有限公司）成立于2008年，总部位于中国上海，是一家屡获殊荣的数字转型咨询公司，专注于中国及亚太市场。我们为最具雄心的《财富》500强企业提供战略与执行方案，通过营销技术（MarTech）、电子商务和全渠道解决方案助力企业实现收入增长与客户忠诚度提升。</p></div>\n      \n        </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n          \n    <div class=\"bg-itc-red text-white py-[50px] px-[15px] md:py-[100px] md:px-[150px] text-center relative\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto font-[\'Lato\',sans-serif] text-[16px] leading-[30px] md:px-[195px]\">\n        \n            <div><p>我们的团队由来自 14 个不同国家的 60 多名积极进取的人才组成, 分布在亚洲的 3 个国家，从中国上海到越南胡志明和新加坡.</p></div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n</div>\n</div>\n              <div><div class=\"paragraph-section-pillars bg-white py-[50px] px-[15px] md:py-[100px] md:px-[150px]\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto text-center\">\n\n              <h2 class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[30px] leading-[36px] text-itc-black mb-0\">\n        \n            <div>实现您成功的四大支柱</div>\n      \n      </h2>\n    \n              <div class=\"font-[\'Lato\',sans-serif] text-[16px] leading-[30px] text-itc-dark-gray mt-[30px] md:px-[97px] mb-[30px] md:mb-[50px] space-y-5 [&_p:not(:last-child)]:mb-5\">\n        \n            <div><p>ITC为全球各行业提供全面的战略咨询与科技开发服务。我们最终致力于协助客户制定最优战略与执行手册，并辅以恰当的数字化工具，助其在中国、亚洲乃至全球市场实现目标。</p><p>融合战略思维与技术专长，与您共同探索下一段成功之路。</p></div>\n      \n      </div>\n    \n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-[30px] text-left\">\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          <div class=\"w-full md:w-[calc(50%-15px)] lg:w-[calc(25%-23px)] flex-grow-0 flex-shrink-0\">\n            \n<div class=\"about-us_pillar bg-itc-light-gray rounded-[20px] py-[40px] px-[25px] pb-[30px] flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full\">\n\n      <div class=\"mb-[40px] h-[120px] w-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n      <div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center [&>img]:max-h-full [&>img]:w-auto [&>img]:object-contain\">\n        \n            <div><div>\n  \n  \n  <div>\n    <div class=\"visually-hidden\">Image</div>\n              <div>  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2025-12/Test.svg\" alt=\"Test svg\" />\n\n</div>\n          </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n      <h3 class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[18px] leading-[26px] text-itc-black\">\n      \n            <div>数字化转型与组织变革管理</div>\n      \n    </h3>\n  \n</div>\n\n          </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full md:w-[calc(50%-15px)] lg:w-[calc(25%-23px)] flex-grow-0 flex-shrink-0\">\n            \n<div class=\"about-us_pillar bg-itc-light-gray rounded-[20px] py-[40px] px-[25px] pb-[30px] flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full\">\n\n      <div class=\"mb-[40px] h-[120px] w-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n      <div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center [&>img]:max-h-full [&>img]:w-auto [&>img]:object-contain\">\n        \n            <div><div>\n  \n  \n  <div>\n    <div class=\"visually-hidden\">Image</div>\n              <div>  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2025-12/Test.svg\" alt=\"Test svg\" />\n\n</div>\n          </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n      <h3 class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[18px] leading-[26px] text-itc-black\">\n      \n            <div>人才扩充</div>\n      \n    </h3>\n  \n</div>\n\n          </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full md:w-[calc(50%-15px)] lg:w-[calc(25%-23px)] flex-grow-0 flex-shrink-0\">\n            \n<div class=\"about-us_pillar bg-itc-light-gray rounded-[20px] py-[40px] px-[25px] pb-[30px] flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full\">\n\n      <div class=\"mb-[40px] h-[120px] w-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n      <div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center [&>img]:max-h-full [&>img]:w-auto [&>img]:object-contain\">\n        \n            <div><div>\n  \n  \n  <div>\n    <div class=\"visually-hidden\">Image</div>\n              <div>  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2025-12/Test.svg\" alt=\"Test svg\" />\n\n</div>\n          </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n      <h3 class=\"font-[\'Ubuntu\',sans-serif] font-bold text-[18px] leading-[26px] text-itc-black\">\n      \n            <div>端到端客户关系管理</div>\n      \n    </h3>\n  \n</div>\n\n          </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full md:w-[calc(50%-15px)] lg:w-[calc(25%-23px)] flex-grow-0 flex-shrink-0\">\n            \n<div class=\"about-us_pillar bg-itc-light-gray rounded-[20px] py-[40px] px-[25px] pb-[30px] flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full\">\n\n      <div class=\