(6311,'The Forum module lets you create threaded discussion forums with functionality similar to other message board systems. In a forum, users post topics and threads in nested hierarchies, allowing discussions to be categorized and grouped.','','none'),
(6312,'A forum is represented by a hierarchical structure, consisting of:','','none'),
(6313,'<em>Forums</em> (for example, <em>Recipes for cooking vegetables</em>)','','none'),
