(9252,'Enter a descriptive <em>Label</em> for your style.','','none'),
(9253,'Select a <em>Breakpoint group</em> from the groups defined by your installed themes and modules.','','none'),
(9254,'On the next page, locate the fieldsets for the breakpoints provided by the selected <em>Breakpoint group</em>.','','none'),
(9255,'For each breakpoint that you want to use, expand the corresponding fieldset. Select the <em>Select a single image style.</em> radio button under <em>Type</em> for the breakpoint, and select the <em>Image style</em> to use for images when that breakpoint is in effect. Repeat this step for the rest of the breakpoints you want to use.','','none'),
