(10074,'Users with the <em>Administer blocks</em> permission can create and edit block types with fields and display settings, from the <a href=\":types\">Block types</a> page under the Structure menu. For more information about managing fields and display settings, see the <a href=\":field-ui\">Field UI module help</a> and <a href=\":field\">Field module help</a>.','','none'),
