(10142,'Instruct browsers to lazy load images if dimensions are specified. Use in conjunction with and place after the \'Track images uploaded via a Text Editor\' filter that adds image dimensions required for lazy loading. Results can be overridden by <code>&lt;img loading=&quot;eager&quot;&gt;</code>.','','none'),
