(10144,'What are content blocks?','','10.5.7'),
(10145,'Content blocks are blocks whose content you can edit. You can define one or more <em>block types</em>, and attach fields to each block type. Content blocks can be placed just like blocks provided by other modules.','','10.5.7'),
(10146,'Overview for managing blocks','','10.5.7'),
(10147,'The <em>Block</em> module allows you to place blocks in regions of your installed themes, and configure block settings. The <em>Block Content</em> module allows you to manage block types and content blocks. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks.','','10.5.7'),
