INSERT INTO `paragraph__field_carousel_items` VALUES
('section_carousel',0,18,440,'en',0,16,438),
('section_carousel',0,18,440,'en',1,22,439);
INSERT INTO `paragraph__field_description` VALUES
('section_text',0,1,423,'en',0,'<p>IT Consultis is an award-winning Digital Transformation Consultancy in China and APAC, empowering the most ambitious Fortune 500 companies with the right strategy &amp; execution playbook leveraging MarTech, e-Commerce, and Omnichannel solutions to grow revenue and build customer loyalty.</p>','basic_html'),
('section_text',0,1,423,'zh-hans',0,'<p>IT Consultis（朗高投资咨询（上海）有限公司）成立于2008年，总部位于中国上海，是一家屡获殊荣的数字转型咨询公司，专注于中国及亚太市场。我们为最具雄心的《财富》500强企业提供战略与执行方案，通过营销技术（MarTech）、电子商务和全渠道解决方案助力企业实现收入增长与客户忠诚度提升。</p>','basic_html'),
('section_pillars',0,6,428,'en',0,'<p>ITC offers a wide range of strategy consulting and technology development services for various industries worldwide.&nbsp;<br>Ultimately, we help our clients develop the best strategies and playbook set-up along with the right digital enablers to achieve their objectives in China, Asia, and other markets.</p><p>Find your next success path with our combined strategic and technology expertis</p>','basic_html'),
('section_pillars',0,6,428,'zh-hans',0,'<p>ITC为全球各行业提供全面的战略咨询与科技开发服务。我们最终致力于协助客户制定最优战略与执行手册，并辅以恰当的数字化工具，助其在中国、亚洲乃至全球市场实现目标。</p><p>融合战略思维与技术专长，与您共同探索下一段成功之路。</p>','basic_html'),
('value_item',0,12,434,'en',0,'<p>Problem-solvers at heart, we firmly believe that we can do everything we set our minds to. Challenges are here for us to tackle - Obstacle is the Way. New knowledge and skills are keys to helping service our clients to beat their competitors. Our commitment is to find solutions to any problem we encounter. We never give up until we find the best way forward. “We figure it out” is more than a value we hold, it is a way of life for us.</p>','basic_html'),
('value_item',0,12,434,'zh-hans',0,'<p>我们天生就是问题解决者，深信只要下定决心，就能克服任何挑战。\"障碍即道路\"是我们的信条。新知识与新技能是我们帮助客户战胜竞争对手的关键。我们承诺为每一个问题找到解决方案，永不放弃，直到找到最佳的前进路径。\"我们探索解决方案\"不仅是我们的核心价值观，更是我们日常的生活方式。</p>','basic_html'),
('value_item',0,13,435,'en',0,'<p>Accountability, taking ownership, and responsibility for our actions and decisions are in our DNA. Taking responsibility rather than blaming others or making excuses and also taking responsibility towards our clients to deliver the best solution out there for them to have the best ROI. We win over our partners\' trust and influence our industry. We create a culture of trust, integrity, and collaboration, where we all contribute to the success of our organization and of our clients.</p>','basic_html'),
('value_item',0,13,435,'zh-hans',0,'<p>责任意识、主动担当以及对自己行为决策的负责精神已深深融入我们的DNA。我们选择主动承担责任，而非推诿找借口，更重要的是，我们对客户负责，致力于为其提供最佳解决方案，实现最优的投资回报。我们赢得了合作伙伴的信任，并积极影响行业的发展。我们致力于营造信任、诚信与协作的文化，每个人都为组织和客户的共同成功贡献着自己的力量。</p>','basic_html'),
('value_item',0,14,436,'en',0,'<p>We are set for collective success. We believe in the power of teamwork and support, and we are always willing to lend a hand to help our colleagues and make an unstoppable team. We are a resilient group, always striving for results and motivated by a shared passion and excitement for what we do.</p>','basic_html'),
('value_item',0,14,436,'zh-hans',0,'<p>我们为集体的成功而生，深信团队协作与相互支持的力量。我们始终乐于伸出援手，帮助同事，打造一个无坚不摧的团队。我们是一个坚韧的集体，始终追求卓越成果。共同的热情与对工作的热爱，是我们持续前进的不竭动力。</p>','basic_html'),
('section_core_values',0,15,437,'en',0,'<p>Our core values define ITC, tie us together, and shape our every action. They drive our business growth to help our clients succeed</p>','basic_html'),
('section_core_values',0,15,437,'zh-hans',0,'<p>我们的核心价值观定义了ITC，紧密连接我们每一位成员，并指引着我们的每一个行动。这些价值观不仅推动着我们的业务增长，也助力客户实现成功。</p>','basic_html'),
('carousel_item',0,16,438,'en',0,'<p><em>“A natural leader with a strategic vision for the long-term development of the companies. Coordinating all finance, HR, and legal-related operations. Ensuring the companies always go in the right direction and each employee is well taken care of, both at a professional and personal level.”</em></p>','basic_html'),
('carousel_item',0,16,438,'zh-hans',0,'<p>“具有长期战略视野的天生领导者，负责企业的财务、人力资源及法律相关事务的统筹运营，确保公司始终朝着正确的方向发展，并关注每位员工的职业及个人成长。”</p>','basic_html'),
('carousel_item',0,17,312,'en',0,'<p>“Serial entrepreneur. Driving the overall expansion and development of ITC in China and Asia. 15+ years of experience advising Fortune 500 C-levels (VP, CIO, CDO, CMO, CTO, GM, etc…) on their brands’ digital acceleration. Always happy to discuss and consult new clients on Private Traffic, eCommerce, sCRM, WeCom, Data Capture, Omnichannel, Loyalty, and how to build the China roadmap the right way. ”</p>','basic_html'),
('carousel_item',0,17,312,'zh-hans',0,'<p>“连续创业者，推动中国及亚洲市场的整体扩展与发展。拥有15 年以上经验，曾为《财富》500强企业的高管(CIO、CDO、CMO、CTO、总经理等)提供数字化加速战略咨询。乐于探讨并为新客户提供咨询，涉及私域流量、电商、企业微信、数据采集、全渠道运营、会员忠诚度计划以及如何正确制定中国市场发展路线图。 ”</p>','basic_html'),
('value_item',0,21,237,'en',0,'<p>原站点 Description中只有一句话，但分为了两行显示，我们的也是一行显示</p>','basic_html'),
('carousel_item',0,22,439,'en',0,'<p>“Serial entrepreneur. Driving the overall expansion and development of ITC in China and Asia. 15+ years of experience advising Fortune 500 C-levels (VP, CIO, CDO, CMO, CTO, GM, etc…) on their brands’ digital acceleration. Always happy to discuss and consult new clients on Private Traffic, eCommerce, sCRM, WeCom, Data Capture, Omnichannel, Loyalty, and how to build the China roadmap the right way. ”</p>','basic_html'),
('carousel_item',0,22,439,'zh-hans',0,'<p>“连续创业者，推动中国及亚洲市场的整体扩展与发展。拥有15 年以上经验，曾为《财富》500强企业的高管(CIO、CDO、CMO、CTO、总经理等)提供数字化加速战略咨询。乐于探讨并为新客户提供咨询，涉及私域流量、电商、企业微信、数据采集、全渠道运营、会员忠诚度计划以及如何正确制定中国市场发展路线图。 ”</p>','basic_html');
