(40,'en','help_search',' creating a user account goal create a new user account steps in the manage administrative menu navigate to people  click add user  enter the email address   username  and password  twice for the new user verify that the roles checked for the new user are correct if you want the new user to receive an email message notifying them of the new account check notify user of new account  optionally change other settings on the form click create new account  you will be left on the add user page repeat these steps if you have more user accounts to create  ',0),
