(78,'en','help_search',' editing a url alias goal change an existing url alias to correct the path or the alias value see configuring aliases for urls for more about aliases who can manage url aliases  users with the administer url aliases permission can edit aliases steps in the manage administration menu navigate to configuration   search and metadata   url aliases  a list of all the site s aliases will appear click edit in the dropdown button for the alias that you would like to change make the required changes and click save  you will be returned to the url alias list page note that you can also add new aliases from this page for any path on your site  ',0),
