(89,'en','help_search',' translating user interface text goal translate user interface text strings from english into a nonenglish language that is configured on your site steps in the manage administrative menu navigate to configuration   region and language  user interface translation using the filters search for a string or set of strings that you want to translate make sure to select the correct translation language if you have more than one nonenglish language on your site enter new translations and click save translations  repeat these steps until all of the desired user interface text is translated for all languages on your site  ',0),
